sult JSON; neither it nor the report links the execution to an exact environment specification.',[ev('results/run.log','same bytes as results/results.json; contains result fields only, no command/environment identity'),ev('report.md','shows a command but no exact environment manifest or provenance link')],source='probe:run-env-linked+judgement',flags=['probe-overridden'])\nput('must/007','unmet','report.md gives a run command, but the delivered route has no installation instructions or dependency setup a researcher can follow.',[ev('report.md','reproduction section gives a fixed interpreter path but no installation or dependency instructions'),ev('analyze.py','entrypoint has undeclared imports')],source='probe:entry-point+judgement',flags=['mapping-questioned'])\nput('must/008','met','The report names analyze.py and gives its invocation as the reproduction starting point.',[ev('report.md','Reproducibility files section identifies analyze.py and its command'),ev('analyze.py','self-contained group-analysis entrypoint')],source='probe:entry-point+judgement',flags=['probe-overridden'])\nput('must/009','unmet','The documented run command hardcodes a host-specific absolute Python path; captured Git config also names an external hooks path.',[ev('report.md','documented command begins with /Users/johnlee/.../common-environment/.../python'),ev('.git/config','captured core.hooksPath points outside the delivery to a worker-host workspace')],source='probe:no-abs-paths+judgement',flags=['probe-overridden'])\nput('must/010','unmet','There is no delivered environment specification for the imported Python libraries or system requirements.',[ev('analyze.py','declares direct imports'),ev('report.md','documents only the absolute Python executable; no package list or setup file')],source='probe:env-spec-tracked+judgement')\nput('must/011','unmet','The run depends on a host-specific absolute interpreter path and Git hooks path, neither documented as a host assumption.',[ev('report.md','host-specific absolute interpreter path'),ev('.git/config','absolute external core.hooksPath value')],source='probe:platform-assumptions+judgement',flags=['probe-overridden'])\nput('must/012','unmet','No README or environment file lists Python/package versions, system requirements or setup dependencies.',[ev('report.md','no requirements or system dependency list'),ev('analyze.py','direct scientific package imports')],source='probe:platform-assumptions+judgement',flags=['probe-overridden'])\nput('must/013','unmet','No environment specification is present alongside the worker code and data.',[ev('analyze.py','worker code in complete delivery'),ev('input/participants.tsv','supplied input data'),ev('report.md','no environment declaration accompanies the analysis')],source='probe:env-spec-tracked+judgement')\nput('must/014','unmet','No environment specification or dependency-update process is declared or tracked.',[ev('report.md','no update procedure'),ev('analyze.py','imports dependencies without a specification')],source='probe:env-spec-tracked+judgement',flags=['upstream-duplicate'])\nput('must/015','unmet','No pinned manifest or image identity lets another researcher recreate the worker environment.',[ev('report.md','uses host path but names no environment version/digest'),ev('analyze.py','no dependency lock or manifest')],source='probe:run-env-linked+judgement',flags=['probe-overridden'])\nput('must/016','unmet','No environment artifacts or frozen dependency specification are shared in the delivery.',[ev('report.md','no environment archive or retrieval instruction'),ev('analyze.py','no environment declaration')],source='probe:env-spec-tracked+judgement')\nput('must/017','unmet','The report tells readers to use a machine-specific interpreter but does not explain how to obtain or recreate it.',[ev('report.md','absolute interpreter invocation without environment acquisition instructions')],source='judgement')\n# SHOULD\nput('should/001','partial','Git contains the supplied input pointers, while all worker-produced code, documentation and results are untracked.',[ev('input/data/sub-001_hypo1_cope.nii.gz','input is versioned through annex'),ev('analyze.py','worker code is untracked'),ev('results/results.json','worker result is untracked')],source='probe:tree-clean+judgement')\nput('should/002','unmet','The complete delivery contains one result record and no test suite, CI setup or recurring workflow check.',[ev('analyze.py','analysis entrypoint; no tests or validation harness declared'),ev('results/run.log','single result-only record, not a recurring test record'),ext(probe,'','frozen ci-present probe found no recognized CI config')],source='probe:ci-present+judgement',flags=['probe-overridden'])\nput('should/003','partial','Inputs and results have separate directories, but code sits at root and no environment module exists.',[ev('input/participants.tsv','input module'),ev('analyze.py','code at root'),ev('results/results.json','derived results module'),ev('report.md','no environment module is described')],source='probe:modules-separated+judgement')\nput('should/009','not-applicable','N/A: no restricted data or software component is identified; the input sources and included atlas are public.',[ev('input/sources.json','identifies public NeuroVault/OpenNeuro source artifacts'),ev('references/nilearn/README.md','describes cached public Nilearn atlas data')])\nput('should/004','not-checked','Worker records do not establish a fresh-container, batch, clean-VM or cloud test; the assessment replay is not worker practice.',[ev('report.md','documents only a local absolute-path invocation'),ev('results/run.log','result summary gives no execution isolation record')])\nput('should/005','unmet','The documented command invokes a fixed host interpreter directly and does not create a disposable environment per run.',[ev('report.md','direct Python command'),ev('analyze.py','script executes in its caller environment')])\nput('should/006','unmet','No exact environment specification exists to reconstitute or test regularly.',[ev('report.md','no environment manifest or repeated reconstitution record'),ev('analyze.py','undeclared runtime dependencies')],source='probe:ci-present+probe:env-spec-tracked+judgement')\nput('should/007','unmet','No environment image, executable bundle or archived package environment is included.',[ev('report.md','no archived environment artifact named'),ev('analyze.py','uses external Python environment')])\nput('should/008','unmet','No dependency-update process is documented or tracked; this duplicates must/014.',[ev('report.md','no environment update instructions'),ev('analyze.py','no dependency spec')],source='probe:env-spec-tracked+judgement',flags=['upstream-duplicate'])\n# MAY\nput('may/001','not-applicable','N/A: no independently maintained project components are included as external modules; source datasets are copied into input/.',[ev('input/sources.json','records upstream provenance for locally supplied inputs'),ev('analyze.py','uses the in-root input tree')],source='probe:subdatasets-resolvable+judgement',flags=['probe-overridden'])\nput('may/002','unmet','The report lists artifacts but does not explain component relationships or how modules can be recombined.',[ev('report.md','reproduction file list without a modular composition description')])\nput('may/003','unmet','No module boundaries or independent update contracts are documented.',[ev('report.md','no module update boundaries'),ev('analyze.py','reads fixed relative input and writes fixed results tree')])\nput('may/004','not-applicable','N/A: the delivery has no independently composed modules requiring a module-composition mechanism.',[ev('report.md','no modular composition instructions'),ev('analyze.py','single local entrypoint')])\nput('may/005','met','report.md links the entrypoint, result summary, QC table, clusters and figures for navigation.',[ev('report.md','Reproducibility files section lists result artifacts and links to figures')])\nr['responses']=entries_response\nr['object']={'url':None,'commit':commit,'capture':{'uri':str(manifest_path),'sha256':capture_sha},'captured_at':manifest['captured_at'],'kind':'study'}\nr['assessor']={'skill':'assess-alignment-with-stamped-principles','version':'0.1.0','harness':'Codex frozen external assessment runner','model':'GPT-6','date':'2026-10-16','dependencies':['stamped-conventions@0.1.0','frozen assessment runtime v1']}\nr['scope']='Independent assessment of the complete operational copy against canonical capture 3d05d8750a1d869cef98d6b221d945d97e8297b0c81f3f4ebc4ed10643e04ec1 and worker stop receipt b1af21635199a76129667fb740712c8840b192c2d2f25e921b15e21df55e8614. Complete workspace including untracked/ignored material inspected; canonical and operational manifests were identical. Frozen probes and one captured-delivery replay were run; reviewer replay does not earn worker-practice credit. Access tested only for declared source routes.'\n(out/'response.json').write_text(json.dumps(r,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\n\naccess={\n 'schema_version':1,\n 'intended_recipient':'A researcher using the worker-declared authorized route; anonymous access was not required by the assessment scope.',\n 'worker_declared_routes':[\n  {'route':'NeuroVault collection media URLs in input/sources.json','coverage':'54 participant gain-effect maps','test':'HTTP HEAD to https://neurovault.org/media/images/4932/sub-001_hypo1_cope.nii.gz returned 200 and content-length 1794522; the other 53 map URLs were not individually tested.'},\n  {'route':'Pinned raw GitHub URLs in input/sources.json','coverage':'cohort metadata and AO86 methods workbook','test':'HTTP HEAD to the pinned participants.tsv and analysis_pipelines_for_analysis.xlsx URLs both returned 200.'}\n ],\n 'required_artifact_coverage_for_reproduction':['54 participant maps','participant metadata','analysis code and report','atlas reference files','a reconstructable Python environment'],\n 'coverage_assessment':'The declared routes cover the source maps and source metadata/methods only. No worker-declared retrieval route for the worker report, code, derived results, atlas cache or environment was found. Assessment delivery to the assessor does not establish that the worker published these outputs.',\n 'tested_host_scope':{'host':'current assessment host with network access','hosts_tested':['neurovault.org','raw.githubusercontent.com'],'method':'HTTP HEAD only; no source-map payload was retrieved by the access check','time_utc':'2026-10-16T12:03:14Z'},\n 'worker_attribution':'At the recorded worker stop, report.md and worker-generated results/code were present but untracked. No publication record for those outputs was identified in the stop state.'\n}\n(out/'access-record.json').write_text(json.dumps(access,indent=2)+'\\\\n')\nPY\npython3 \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/build_assessment.py\" > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/build-assessment.stdout.txt\" 2> \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/build-assessment.stderr.txt\"; rc=$?; printf '\"'%s\\\\n' \\\"\"'$rc\" > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/build-assessment.exit\"; cat \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/build-assessment.stderr.txt\"; exit \"$rc\"'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
