{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_39","type":"command_execution","command":"/opt/homebrew/bin/bash -lc 'mkdir -p \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors\"; cat > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/cat-missing-path.command.txt\" <<'\"'EOF'\ncat \\\"\"'$(dirname \"$STAMPED_DELIVERY_MANIFEST\")/judge-target.json\"\nEOF\ncat > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/cat-missing-path.stdout.txt\" <<'\"'EOF'\nEOF\ncat > \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/cat-missing-path.stderr.txt\" <<'\"'EOF'\ncat: /Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/targets/narps-neutral-r1-19-j01/canonical/judge-target.json: No such file or directory\nEOF\nprintf '%s\\\\n' '1' > \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/cat-missing-path.exit\"; cat > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/invalid-runner-action.command.txt\" <<'\"'EOF'\n\\\"\"'$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_PYTHON\" \"$STAMPED_ASSESSMENT_RUNNER\" probe --help\nEOF\ncat > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/invalid-runner-action.stderr.txt\" <<'\"'EOF'\nusage: assessment.py [-h] {check,probes,response,validate,fresh-rerun} ...\nassessment.py: error: argument action: invalid choice: 'probe' (choose from 'check', 'probes', 'response', 'validate', 'fresh-rerun')\nEOF\nprintf '%s\\\\n' '2' > \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/invalid-runner-action.exit\"; cat > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/find-printf.command.txt\" <<'\"'EOF'\nfind \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_TARGET\" -type f -not -path '\"'*/.git/*' -printf '%s %P\\\\n'\nfind \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_TARGET/input/data\" -type f -maxdepth 1 -printf '\"'%s %f\\\\n'\nEOF\ncat > \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/find-printf.stderr.txt\" <<'\"'EOF'\nfind: -printf: unknown primary or operator\nfind: -printf: unknown primary or operator\nEOF\nprintf '%s\\\\n' '1' > \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/find-printf.exit\"; cat > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/system-python-items.command.txt\" <<'\"'EOF'\npython3 /Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-ai-research-next/stamped-judge-piveaenq/skills/stamped-conventions/scripts/encode_response.py items\nEOF\ncat > \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/system-python-items.stderr.txt\" <<'\"'EOF'\nTraceback (most recent call last):\n  File \\\"/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-ai-research-next/stamped-judge-piveaenq/skills/stamped-conventions/scripts/encode_response.py\\\", line 37, in <module>\n    from jsonschema import Draft202012Validator, FormatChecker\nModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'jsonschema'\nEOF\nprintf '%s\\\\n' '1' > \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/early-errors/system-python-items.exit\"; cat > \"$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/assessor-notes.md\" <<'\"'EOF'\n# Assessor-side command issues\n\nThese were command/tooling mistakes or an auxiliary interpreter limitation, not target findings:\n\n- Looked for \"'`judge-target.json` under `canonical/`; it is in the assessment output directory. The correct file was read before grading.\n- Invoked runner action `probe` instead of `probes`; the frozen runner rejected the action. The correct frozen probe action then ran successfully.\n- macOS `find` does not support GNU `-printf`; only the inventory display failed. The target remained unchanged.\n- Calling the checklist helper with system `python3` failed because that interpreter lacks `jsonschema`. The required frozen runner'\"'s own environment was used for response validation and checklist URL encoding, both successfully.\n\nNo scientific replay failed. The replay record is the single authorized attempt.\nEOF\ncat > \\\"\"'$STAMPED_JUDGE_OUTPUT/commands/session-index.md\" <<'\"'EOF'\n# Assessment command and artifact index\n\nEvery substantive frozen-runner action has a distinct command, stdout, stderr, and exit file in this directory. Generated evidence and artifacts are retained at their original output paths.\n\n- \"'`runner-check.*`: frozen runtime check (also completed before probes).\n- `checklist-pin.*`: vendor checklist pin check.\n- `probes.*`: full frozen probe sweep and response draft; `response-probe-draft.json` preserves the unjudged draft.\n- `replay.*`, `replay/work/`: single complete-capture replay, selected-output copies, and replay stdout/stderr.\n- `access-route.*`, `access-sources.*`: HTTP HEAD route checks for one map and the two pinned raw-source URLs.\n- `validate-response.*`, `validate-scientific.*`, `encode-url.*`: final frozen validation and URL generation.\n- `verify_operational_integrity.*` and `operational-integrity.json`: full path/mode/content comparison to the operational starting manifest.\n- `response-table.*`: rendered pinned per-item table.\n- `early-errors/` and `assessor-notes.md`: preserved incidental command failures; they are assessor-side and not target behavior.\n- `build_assessment.py`, `build_report.py`, their command receipts, and outputs: scripts used to create the assessment artifacts.\nEOF\n'","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
