{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_48","type":"agent_message","text":"The assessment is complete. **Scientific adequacy is qualified**: the group analysis is defensible for the supplied participant maps, but its inference depends on sign-flip assumptions, equal weighting without participant variance maps, and approximate spatial resampling. The reported conclusion is that the data do not support a positive vmPFC effect under whole-brain FWER correction; that conclusion is kept separate from adequacy.\n\nThe frozen replay reproduced the selected result summary, participant QC table, and cluster table byte-for-byte. It did not compare the full NIfTI maps or figures. The response and scientific record both validated successfully.\n\n- [Assessment report](/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/judgments/narps-neutral-r1-19-j01/attempt-01/judgment/2026-10-16-assessment.md)\n- [Response JSON](/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/judgments/narps-neutral-r1-19-j01/attempt-01/judgment/response.json)\n- [Scientific judgment record](/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/judgments/narps-neutral-r1-19-j01/attempt-01/judgment/scientific-judgment.json)\n- [Probe results](/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/judgments/narps-neutral-r1-19-j01/attempt-01/judgment/probes.json) · [Replay record](/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/judgments/narps-neutral-r1-19-j01/attempt-01/judgment/fresh-rerun.json)\n- [Access record](/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/judgments/narps-neutral-r1-19-j01/attempt-01/judgment/access-record.json) · [Checklist link](/Users/johnlee/.local/state/stamped-in-practice/narps-neutral-v1/assessment-series/narps-neutral-r1-operational-v4/judgments/narps-neutral-r1-19-j01/attempt-01/judgment/2026-10-16-url.txt)\n\nThe initial canonical and operational capture manifests matched. Final integrity checking found no other target changes; one `.git/annex/keysdb/db` change was classified as operational metadata, with logical database equivalence unverified."}}
